📌 Overall meaning:

Initializes only id and name.

🧩 Terms:
parameters → input values
constructor overloading → multiple constructors
⭐ Alternatives:
setter methods instead of constructor
6. 🏗️ Full Constructor
public Product(int id, String name, double price, int quantity)
📌 Overall meaning:

Initializes all product values.

⭐ Alternatives:
builder pattern (advanced OOP)
setters after object creation
