⚡ CONCEPTUAL VIVA QUESTIONS (IMPORTANT)
❓ Why do we use class Product?

👉 To represent real-world entity with properties and behavior.

❓ What is encapsulation?

👉 Wrapping data inside class and making variables private.

❓ Why private variables?

👉 To protect data from direct access.

❓ What is constructor overloading?

👉 Multiple constructors with different parameters.

❓ Why ArrayList used instead of array?

👉 Because ArrayList is dynamic (size can change).

❓ Difference between List and ArrayList?

👉 List is interface, ArrayList is implementation.

❓ Why use generics <Product>?

👉 To ensure type safety and avoid runtime errors.

❓ What is enhanced for loop?

👉 Simplified loop to iterate collections.

❓ What is return type of getTotal()?

👉 double (because it returns calculated value)

❓ Why do we use Scanner here?

👉 To take user input from keyboard.

❓ What is final invoice method doing?

👉 It calculates subtotal, applies discount, and prints bill.

❓ What is real-world use of this program?

👉 Shopping cart systems in e-commerce apps.

